  <p>This policy describes how Revvia Marketing (First Door, LLC) delivers and bills for its services.</p>

  <h2>What we provide</h2>
  <p>Marketing and growth services - paid media management, SEO and AI visibility, in-house photo and video production, email and SMS retention, website work, tracking and measurement, and related strategy - for home services, B2B and industrial, healthcare, and consumer businesses.</p>

  <h2>Service delivery</h2>
  <p>Services are delivered digitally, in person, and on scheduled production days. Timelines are set in your engagement agreement. Most engagements begin within one to two weeks of signing, once onboarding and platform access are complete. All content goes through your approval before it's published.</p>

  <h2>Billing</h2>
  <p>Our monthly service fee is billed in advance. You pay advertising platforms (Google, Meta, and others) directly from your own ad accounts - Revvia never invoices ad spend. Project and production work outside a retainer is billed per its project agreement.</p>

  <h2>Ownership</h2>
  <p>Your ad accounts, analytics, website, CRM, and customer lists stay in your name. We're granted access; we never take ownership. You own the content we create in any month you've paid for.</p>

  <h2>Cancellation and refunds</h2>
  <p>Engagements are month-to-month with no long-term contract. You can cancel with written notice as described in your agreement. Because our services are labor and media management already performed, fees are non-refundable except where California law requires otherwise.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:info@revvia.com">info@revvia.com</a> · <a href="tel:+17607822875">(760) 782-2875</a></p>
